{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And they added still more to hate him.</b> Three hatreds are recalled here: for at first they hated him on account of bringing the evil report, and from then on they refused to speak with him, as it is written (Genesis 37:4), ״וְלֹא יָכְלוּ דַּבְּרוֹ לְשָׁלֹם״. And afterward, ״וַיַּחֲלֹם יוֹסֵף חֲלוֹם וַיַּגֵּד לְאֶחָיו״ (Genesis 37:5) — he had not yet told them the content of the dream, for it does not say 'and he told it to his brothers,' but rather he began to speak with them and said to them, 'Hear, for I have dreamed a dream'; immediately ״וַיּוֹסִפוּ עוֹד שְׂנֹא אֹתוֹ״, because he began to speak with them when they did not want to speak with him. And because this hatred was in the heart and Joseph did not sense it, he therefore spoke in supplication: ״שִׁמְעוּ נָא הַחֲלוֹם הַזֶּה״ and so on (Genesis 37:6). Then they opened their mouths against their will and said, ״הֲמָלֹךְ תִּמְלֹךְ עָלֵינוּ״ (Genesis 37:8). Therefore, ״וַיּוֹסִפוּ עוֹד שְׂנֹא אֹתוֹ עַל חֲלֹמֹתָיו וְעַל דְּבָרָיו״ (Genesis 37:8) — not only did they hate him on account of his dreams, but even on account of his words they hated him, for he wanted to speak with them against their will." "And some say <b>עַל דְּבָרָיו — 'on account of his words.'</b> For all dreams follow the mouth (ברכות נה:), meaning that from whatever a person speaks before he sleeps, from that same sort comes his dream — for ״בָּא הַחֲלוֹם בְּרֹב עִנְיָן וְקוֹל כְּסִיל בְּרֹב דְּבָרִים״ (Ecclesiastes 5:2), for the vanities about which the fool raises his voice — these cause him a multitude of dreams of vanities. Therefore they reasoned that presumably before sleep Joseph had been speaking or pondering in his heart that he was worthy of kingship, and therefore this dream came to him. Thus they hated him עַל דְּבָרָיו — on account of his words of the mouth, or on account of words of the heart."], :book :genesis, :voice :kli-yakar, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:32:16.779691413Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}